(7695978, 1262046, 173844, '<td valign="top">A chilling vision of a possible future.  I guess it''ll be ok as long as they keep taxes down.<br/>The dark and gray color scheme and the overwhelming sense of vulnerability are tone perfect.  The photography and the fully fleshed out imagination are superb.  The shadowy details in the background might easily be given short shrift, but not so here.  Actually, we''ve come to expect no less.  Who are the figures overhead, all headed in the same direction?  Souls, untethered dreams?<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'A chilling vision of a possible future.  I guess it''ll be ok as long as they keep taxes down.The dark and gray color scheme and the overwhelming sense of vulnerability are tone perfect.  The photography and the fully fleshed out imagination are superb.  The shadowy details in the background might easily be given short shrift, but not so here.  Actually, we''ve come to expect no less.  Who are the figures overhead, all headed in the same direction?  Souls, untethered dreams?Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-06-13 22:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7695980, 1262059, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrayal, real or nudged by imagination, of that instant when the afternoon kisses the evening.  So very evocative.  The figurative cloud formation on the left brings home that we''re not in Kansas.  Charmingly grotesque.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful portrayal, real or nudged by imagination, of that instant when the afternoon kisses the evening.  So very evocative.  The figurative cloud formation on the left brings home that we''re not in Kansas.  Charmingly grotesque.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2021-06-13 23:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7695981, 1262053, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsomely fashioned, graphically compelling.  Would make a great poster.</td>', 'Handsomely fashioned, graphically compelling.  Would make a great poster.', '2021-06-13 23:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7695983, 1262060, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovingly given to us, this seemingly straightforward image is beautiful and moving.  Not just the donkeys/burros/mules (don''t know), but also the sun-drenched sky, the bright field and the flowered shadow pathway.  The composition is quirky but does work.  Still, we come back to the tenderness of the animals.<br/>Come to think of it, a second second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovingly given to us, this seemingly straightforward image is beautiful and moving.  Not just the donkeys/burros/mules (don''t know), but also the sun-drenched sky, the bright field and the flowered shadow pathway.  The composition is quirky but does work.  Still, we come back to the tenderness of the animals.Come to think of it, a second second favorite of the challenge.', '2021-06-13 23:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
