(7695999, 1262046, 141319, '<td valign="top">Fabulous, just fabulous. <br/> <br/>Yes, priorities in our lives and how to best achieve them are a difficult topic, finding the balance and especially the peace in your heart to believe you are doing the right thing is hard. <br/> <br/>Pls,pls tell me where you got these masks from? I thought you had "created them" in PS, but so much easier if one can buy them :-).</td>', 'Fabulous, just fabulous.  Yes, priorities in our lives and how to best achieve them are a difficult topic, finding the balance and especially the peace in your heart to believe you are doing the right thing is hard.  Pls,pls tell me where you got these masks from? I thought you had "created them" in PS, but so much easier if one can buy them :-).', '2021-06-14 06:48:36.000000', NULL, 0),
