(7696008, 1262046, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Christophe! For the blue, for your new PB and for the new top score for DPC. (Such a long, long time!) Congratulations for creating such a fabulous work. <br/>Thank you for your notes. I empathise with you in your hopes and concerns for your family. I have all confidence that you will do a fantastic job in this role, too.<br/>Thank you for your technical notes. I love reading how you have gone about creating your art. (Please tell me that you didn''t shave your daughter''s head ;-)</td>', 'Congratulations, Christophe! For the blue, for your new PB and for the new top score for DPC. (Such a long, long time!) Congratulations for creating such a fabulous work. Thank you for your notes. I empathise with you in your hopes and concerns for your family. I have all confidence that you will do a fantastic job in this role, too.Thank you for your technical notes. I love reading how you have gone about creating your art. (Please tell me that you didn''t shave your daughter''s head ;-)', '2021-06-14 09:27:08.000000', NULL, 0),
