(7696063, 1262046, 60581, '<td valign="top">Question I would have is, how long did this image take you from start to finish? I have been watching this one many times every day, this one is I agree you best creation and I am in love with this!</td>', 'Question I would have is, how long did this image take you from start to finish? I have been watching this one many times every day, this one is I agree you best creation and I am in love with this!', '2021-06-15 11:44:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696065, 1262046, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pgirish007:</b></div><hr/><i> Question I would have is, how long did this image take you from start to finish? I have been watching this one many times every day, this one is I agree you best creation and I am in love with this! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks again for the kind words!<br/> <br/>Regarding the time spent on this image, it is hard to tell precisely. It should be something like that:<br/>- Going through Pink Floyd lyrics, for inspiration and discussing about the first ideas with my wife: around 1h<br/>- Thinking about the composition and sketching the main concept, searching and ordering masks: around 3h (not continuously)<br/>- Searching for the various industrial facilities and which one offers decent access for photos: 1h (Google Maps / Google Street)<br/>- Facility photos: 2h (driving included)<br/>- Outfit preparation + lighting setup: 1h<br/>- Main characters shooting session: 1h<br/>- Additional shootings: 2h (masks, pipes, clouds, flying men)<br/>- Editing: Clouds/Smoke 1h, Industrial complex 3h, Main characters 8h, Flying men 3h, Various additional polishing 3h<br/>Approx. total = 29h</td>', 'Originally posted by pgirish007: Question I would have is, how long did this image take you from start to finish? I have been watching this one many times every day, this one is I agree you best creation and I am in love with this!   Thanks again for the kind words! Regarding the time spent on this image, it is hard to tell precisely. It should be something like that:- Going through Pink Floyd lyrics, for inspiration and discussing about the first ideas with my wife: around 1h- Thinking about the composition and sketching the main concept, searching and ordering masks: around 3h (not continuously)- Searching for the various industrial facilities and which one offers decent access for photos: 1h (Google Maps / Google Street)- Facility photos: 2h (driving included)- Outfit preparation + lighting setup: 1h- Main characters shooting session: 1h- Additional shootings: 2h (masks, pipes, clouds, flying men)- Editing: Clouds/Smoke 1h, Industrial complex 3h, Main characters 8h, Flying men 3h, Various additional polishing 3hApprox. total = 29h', '2021-06-15 13:22:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696067, 1261948, 19825, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.</td>', 'This is lovely.', '2021-06-15 13:57:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696077, 1262015, 114969, '<td valign="top">It''s probably one of Pink FLoyd''s song I have listened the most: the two guitar solos are just incredible and unforgettable. I even was lucky enough to see David Gilmour during his 2015 tour playing it, what a memory! So thanks a lot for your entry, I would have been disappointed without it. Now of course, playing the guitar with these hands looks tricky ;)</td>', 'It''s probably one of Pink FLoyd''s song I have listened the most: the two guitar solos are just incredible and unforgettable. I even was lucky enough to see David Gilmour during his 2015 tour playing it, what a memory! So thanks a lot for your entry, I would have been disappointed without it. Now of course, playing the guitar with these hands looks tricky ;)', '2021-06-15 20:40:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696079, 1262040, 114969, '<td valign="top">I had (and still have) many cats in my life. As one could expect, I have also lost several of my old friends along the road: it hurt each time the same, and still does. Nonetheless, I love looking at old pictures showing them, and remembering all the good times. I cherish these memories. This song is perfect match for these feelings. I wish you all the best.</td>', 'I had (and still have) many cats in my life. As one could expect, I have also lost several of my old friends along the road: it hurt each time the same, and still does. Nonetheless, I love looking at old pictures showing them, and remembering all the good times. I cherish these memories. This song is perfect match for these feelings. I wish you all the best.', '2021-06-15 20:48:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696080, 1261947, 114969, '<td valign="top">Your entries are often bold, but they never disappoint. I often search for your photo when browsing challenges. With this picture, you managed to show exactly the type of scenery that would be in front of the eyes, while being lost in thoughts. I would have never managed to recreate this feeling in an image. Admirable. Thanks for doing what you do.</td>', 'Your entries are often bold, but they never disappoint. I often search for your photo when browsing challenges. With this picture, you managed to show exactly the type of scenery that would be in front of the eyes, while being lost in thoughts. I would have never managed to recreate this feeling in an image. Admirable. Thanks for doing what you do.', '2021-06-15 20:52:15.000000', NULL, 0),
