 1h- Thinking about the composition and sketching the main concept, searching and ordering masks: around 3h (not continuously)- Searching for the various industrial facilities and which one offers decent access for photos: 1h (Google Maps / Google Street)- Facility photos: 2h (driving included)- Outfit preparation + lighting setup: 1h- Main characters shooting session: 1h- Additional shootings: 2h (masks, pipes, clouds, flying men)- Editing: Clouds/Smoke 1h, Industrial complex 3h, Main characters 8h, Flying men 3h, Various additional polishing 3hApprox. total = 29h   Wow this is very interesting to read! Thanks for sharing this.', '2021-06-18 12:00:58.000000', NULL, 0),
